{"seq":3,"slug":"perf-analysis-optimization","title":"性能分析与优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/hpc-practice/perf-analysis-optimization","wordCount":2759,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"性能分析与优化\">性能分析与优化</h1><p>一个三维有限元仿真在 1000 个 CPU 核心上运行了 48 小时才完成，其中 30 小时花在了全局归约操作上，10 小时花在了缓存未命中导致的内存等待上——如果不进行系统的性能分析，这些瓶颈可能永远不会被发现。性能分析（profiling）是科学计算工程实践中不可或缺的环节：它告诉我们时间花在了哪里，哪里有改进空间，以及优化是否真的有效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>科学计算程序的性能受三个基本因素制约：计算吞吐量（FLOPS/s）、内存带宽（bytes/s）和通信延迟/带宽。哪个因素成为瓶颈取决于算法的算术强度（arithmetic intensity）——每字节内存访问对应的浮点运算次数。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[性能分析流程] --&gt; B[测量]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[计时/插桩]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[硬件计数器]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[采样]&#10;    A --&gt; C[分析]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[热点识别]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[瓶颈分类]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[Roofline 模型]&#10;    A --&gt; D[优化]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[算法改进]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[数据布局]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[并行策略]&#10;    D --&gt; D4[向量化]&#10;    C2 --&gt; E{瓶颈类型?}&#10;    E --&gt;|计算受限| F[算法优化/向量化]&#10;    E --&gt;|内存受限| G[数据布局/缓存优化]&#10;    E --&gt;|通信受限| H[减少通信/重叠]\">graph TD\n    A[性能分析流程] --&gt; B[测量]\n    B --&gt; B1[计时/插桩]\n    B --&gt; B2[硬件计数器]\n    B --&gt; B3[采样]\n    A --&gt; C[分析]\n    C --&gt; C1[热点识别]\n    C --&gt; C2[瓶颈分类]\n    C --&gt; C3[Roofline 模型]\n    A --&gt; D[优化]\n    D --&gt; D1[算法改进]\n    D --&gt; D2[数据布局]\n    D --&gt; D3[并行策略]\n    D --&gt; D4[向量化]\n    C2 --&gt; E{瓶颈类型?}\n    E --&gt;|计算受限| F[算法优化/向量化]\n    E --&gt;|内存受限| G[数据布局/缓存优化]\n    E --&gt;|通信受限| H[减少通信/重叠]</pre><p>Roofline 模型（Williams et al., 2009）是可视化和理解性能瓶颈的经典工具。它在一张图上绘制两条&quot;屋顶线&quot;：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>计算屋顶线</strong>：水平直线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = P_{\\text{peak}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，表示处理器的峰值浮点性能。</li>\n<li><strong>内存屋顶线</strong>：斜率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>（内存带宽）的直线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = B \\cdot I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 是算术强度。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对于给定的 kernel 或程序，其算术强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 和实测性能 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 对应图上的一个点。如果该点在内存屋顶线下方，程序是内存带宽受限的；如果在计算屋顶线下方，是计算受限的。两条屋顶线的交点定义了&quot;脊点&quot;（ridge point），其算术强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>I</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I^* = P_{\\text{peak}} / B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 是从内存受限过渡到计算受限的阈值。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化策略</th>\n<th>目标瓶颈</th>\n<th>预期收益</th>\n<th>实现难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>算法改进（降低复杂度）</td>\n<td>计算</td>\n<td>数量级</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据布局优化</td>\n<td>内存带宽</td>\n<td>2-10 倍</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环分块（tiling）</td>\n<td>缓存</td>\n<td>2-5 倍</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>向量化（SIMD）</td>\n<td>计算</td>\n<td>2-8 倍</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通信-计算重叠</td>\n<td>通信延迟</td>\n<td>1.2-2 倍</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预取</td>\n<td>内存延迟</td>\n<td>1.2-2 倍</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线程亲和性</td>\n<td>NUMA</td>\n<td>1.2-3 倍</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"性能测量方法\">性能测量方法</h2><p>性能测量的三种基本技术：计时、采样和硬件计数器。</p>\n<p>**计时（Timing）**是最简单的方法：在代码中插入时间戳，测量代码段的执行时间。<code>MPI_Wtime()</code> 是 MPI 程序的标准选择，<code>std::chrono::high_resolution_clock</code> 是 C++ 的通用选项，Python 中使用 <code>time.perf_counter()</code>。计时的关键是多次测量取平均以消除系统噪声，并确保测量的代码段足够长（至少几毫秒）以克服计时器精度。</p>\n<p>**采样（Sampling）**周期性地中断程序，记录当前的程序计数器（PC）和调用栈。统计采样结果可以得到各函数/代码行的执行时间占比。Linux <code>perf</code> 工具的 <code>perf record</code> / <code>perf report</code> 是采样分析的标准工具。采样的优势是开销低（通常 &lt; 5%），不需要修改代码；劣势是统计精度依赖采样频率和运行时间。</p>\n<p>**硬件计数器（Hardware Counters）**是 CPU 内置的专用寄存器，计数微架构事件：缓存未命中、分支预测错误、浮点指令、内存事务等。<code>perf stat</code> 提供高层摘要，<code>perf record -e</code> 可以计数特定事件。VTune 和 Nsight Compute 提供更友好的界面和更深入的分析。</p>\n<p>关键的硬件计数器事件：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>LLC-loads</code> / <code>LLC-load-misses</code>：最后一级缓存（L3）的访问和未命中。高未命中率表明数据局部性差。</li>\n<li><code>branch-misses</code>：分支预测错误。高比率表明控制流不规则（如稀疏矩阵遍历）。</li>\n<li><code>instructions</code> / <code>cycles</code>：指令数和周期数。IPC（Instructions Per Cycle）= instructions/cycles，现代 CPU 的 IPC 上限约为 3-4。</li>\n<li><code>fp_arith_inst_retired</code>：退休的浮点算术指令数，用于估算实际 FLOPS。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"科学计算的典型瓶颈\">科学计算的典型瓶颈</h2><h3 id=\"内存带宽受限\">内存带宽受限</h3><p>内存带宽受限是科学计算中最常见的瓶颈。典型症状：IPC 低（&lt; 1），LLC 未命中率高（&gt; 20%），<code>perf stat</code> 显示 <code>mem-bound</code> 指标高。</p>\n<p>有限差分模板是内存带宽受限的典型例子。拉普拉斯模板每个网格点更新需要 7 次内存读取和 1 次写入，但只有约 10 次浮点运算。算术强度约为 10 FLOPs / (8 × 8 bytes) ≈ 0.16 FLOPs/byte，远低于典型 CPU 的脊点（约 2-4 FLOPs/byte）。</p>\n<p>缓解策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>循环分块（loop tiling / blocking）</strong>：将计算分解为适合缓存大小的数据块。二维模板的分块将大网格切分为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B \\times B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 的块，块大小选择为使得一个块的数据能放入 L1 或 L2 缓存。</li>\n<li><strong>数据结构重组（Array of Structures → Structure of Arrays）</strong>：将 AoS 布局改为 SoA 布局，使得对同一字段的连续访问成为连续内存访问。</li>\n<li><strong>软件预取（software prefetching）</strong>：在数据被使用前几个迭代发出预取指令，将数据提前加载到缓存。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"计算受限\">计算受限</h3><p>计算受限的程序受限于处理器的浮点吞吐量。典型症状：IPC 高（&gt; 2），缓存未命中率低，实测 FLOPS 接近峰值的显著比例。</p>\n<p>矩阵乘法（BLAS GEMM）是计算受限的典型。对于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\times N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 矩阵乘法，算术强度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2N^3 / (3N^2 \\cdot 8) = N / 12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/12</span></span></span></span></span> FLOPs/byte。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 足够大时（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N &gt; 1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span>），算术强度远超脊点，计算成为瓶颈。</p>\n<p>优化策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>向量化（SIMD）</strong>：利用 CPU 的 SIMD 指令（AVX-512、NEON）一次处理多个数据元素。编译器自动向量化在简单循环上效果好，但复杂循环需要手动提示或使用 intrinsic 函数。</li>\n<li><strong>循环展开（loop unrolling）</strong>：减少循环控制开销，增加指令级并行。</li>\n<li><strong>BLAS 调用</strong>：对于线性代数运算，调用优化的 BLAS 库（OpenBLAS、MKL、BLIS）而非手写循环。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"通信受限\">通信受限</h3><p>并行程序中，通信开销可能主导总运行时间。在 <a href=\"parallel-mpi\">并行计算与 MPI</a> 中讨论的全局归约（<code>MPI_Allreduce</code>）操作是常见的通信瓶颈——它的延迟随进程数对数增长（对树形算法），且无法被计算完全掩盖。</p>\n<p>缓解策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>减少全局通信</strong>：用局部操作替代全局操作。例如，用块 Jacobi 预条件子替代需要全局内积的 CG 方法（牺牲一些收敛速度以换取更好的并行扩展性）。</li>\n<li><strong>通信-计算重叠</strong>：使用非阻塞 MPI 操作（<code>MPI_Iallreduce</code>、<code>MPI_Isend</code>/<code>MPI_Irecv</code>），在通信进行的同时执行独立的计算。</li>\n<li><strong>进程拓扑优化</strong>：将通信密集的进程映射到物理上相邻的节点（同一机架、同一交换机），降低网络延迟。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"分析工具链\">分析工具链</h2><p>选择合适的工具是高效性能分析的第一步。</p>\n<p><strong>CPU 分析工具</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Linux perf</strong>：开源、零安装、功能全面。<code>perf top</code> 实时显示热点函数，<code>perf record -g</code> + <code>perf report</code> 提供调用图分析。</li>\n<li><strong>Intel VTune Profiler</strong>：商业工具，提供最全面的微架构分析。热点分析、内存访问分析、线程分析、HPC 性能特征化等专用视图。对 Intel CPU 的硬件计数器事件有最完整的支持。</li>\n<li><strong>AMD uProf</strong>：AMD 处理器的对应工具。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>GPU 分析工具</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>NVIDIA Nsight Systems</strong>：系统级时间线分析，展示 CPU 线程、GPU kernel、CUDA API、MPI 通信、OS 运行时的时间分布。是理解应用整体执行流程的首选。</li>\n<li><strong>NVIDIA Nsight Compute</strong>：单个 kernel 的详细性能分析。提供内存事务、指令吞吐量、warp 效率、占用率等指标，以及 Roofline 和 Speed of Light 图表。</li>\n<li><strong>ROCm Profiler</strong>：AMD GPU 的分析工具。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>并行分析工具</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Score-P + Vampir</strong>：高性能计算的标准插桩分析工具链。Score-P 负责在编译/运行时插桩，Vampir 提供交互式时间线和统计分析。支持 MPI、OpenMP、CUDA 及其混合。</li>\n<li><strong>TAU</strong>：另一个成熟的 HPC 性能分析框架，支持多种插桩方式和大规模并行分析。</li>\n<li><strong>Intel Trace Analyzer and Collector (ITAC)</strong>：MPI 通信的专用分析工具，提供通信矩阵、时间线、不平衡分析。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"优化案例-有限元组装\">优化案例：有限元组装</h2><p>有限元组装是 <a href=\"../pde-numerical-methods/finite-element\">有限元法</a> 中的核心操作，也是典型的性能瓶颈。对一个有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个自由度的三维问题，组装可能占总运行时间的 30-60%。</p>\n<p>典型优化路径：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>测量</strong>：用 <code>perf record -g</code> 确认热点在单元循环和局部刚度矩阵计算。</li>\n<li><strong>分析</strong>：<code>perf stat</code> 显示 LLC 未命中率高（单元数据分散在内存中），IPC 低（约 0.8）。</li>\n<li><strong>优化 1 - 数据布局</strong>：将单元数据从 AoS（每个单元的节点坐标和材料属性分散存储）改为 SoA（所有单元的同一属性连续存储）。这改善了空间局部性，LLC 未命中率降低 40%。</li>\n<li><strong>优化 2 - 单元排序</strong>：按空间局部性（如 Hilbert 曲线排序）重新排列单元，使得相邻单元在内存中也相邻。这进一步改善了缓存行为。</li>\n<li><strong>优化 3 - 向量化</strong>：对局部刚度矩阵的计算循环添加 <code>#pragma omp simd</code> 提示，启用 SIMD 向量化。</li>\n<li><strong>验证</strong>：重新运行 <code>perf stat</code>，确认 IPC 提升到 1.5，总运行时间降低 55%。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这个例子说明了性能优化的迭代本质：测量 → 分析 → 优化 → 验证。每次只做一个改动，测量其效果，然后决定下一步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"roofline-模型的实际应用\">Roofline 模型的实际应用</h2><p>将 Roofline 模型应用于实际程序需要以下步骤：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>确定硬件参数</strong>：CPU/GPU 的峰值浮点性能 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{peak}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和内存带宽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>。这些可以从厂商规格或微基准测试（如 STREAM、LINPACK）获得。</li>\n<li><strong>测量程序指标</strong>：总浮点运算次数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>（通过硬件计数器或算法分析）、总内存流量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>（通过硬件计数器）、总运行时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>计算算术强度</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I = W / Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> FLOPs/byte。</li>\n<li><strong>计算实测性能</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = W / T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> FLOPS/s。</li>\n<li><strong>在 Roofline 图上定位</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>I</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(I, P)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 点的位置揭示了瓶颈类型。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对于一个三维有限差分代码，假设：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>硬件：双精度峰值 2 TFLOPS/s，内存带宽 100 GB/s</li>\n<li>测量：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W = 10^{10}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> FLOPs，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q = 50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span> GB，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> s</li>\n<li>算术强度：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I = 10^{10} / (50 \\times 10^9) = 0.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span></span></span></span></span> FLOPs/byte</li>\n<li>实测性能：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>0.5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = 10^{10} / 0.5 = 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> GFLOPS/s</li>\n<li>内存屋顶线在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=0.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span></span></span></span></span> 处的值：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100 \\times 0.2 = 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> GFLOPS/s</li>\n</ul>\n<p>程序恰好落在内存屋顶线上——确认是内存带宽受限的。要进一步提升性能，需要提高算术强度（如同时计算多个时间步以重用数据）或使用更高带宽的内存（如 HBM）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>性能分析与优化是科学计算工程实践的核心环节。Roofline 模型提供了理解瓶颈的统一框架，硬件计数器和采样工具提供了测量手段，而数据布局优化、向量化、通信重叠等技术提供了具体的改进路径。优化的关键原则是：先测量后优化，每次只改一个变量，用数据而非直觉指导决策。在实际项目中，一个经过系统优化的代码可以比未经优化的版本快 10 倍甚至 100 倍——这直接决定了一个仿真是否在时间和预算上可行。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"性能分析与优化","id":"性能分析与优化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"性能测量方法","id":"性能测量方法"},{"level":2,"text":"科学计算的典型瓶颈","id":"科学计算的典型瓶颈"},{"level":3,"text":"内存带宽受限","id":"内存带宽受限"},{"level":3,"text":"计算受限","id":"计算受限"},{"level":3,"text":"通信受限","id":"通信受限"},{"level":2,"text":"分析工具链","id":"分析工具链"},{"level":2,"text":"优化案例：有限元组装","id":"优化案例-有限元组装"},{"level":2,"text":"Roofline 模型的实际应用","id":"roofline-模型的实际应用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"GPU 加速与 CUDA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/hpc-practice/gpu-cuda-acceleration"},"next":null}